WEBVTT

00:25:58.661 --> 00:26:02.798
It just makes me want
to love this world more.

00:26:02.822 --> 00:26:06.263
CA: Yeah. I mean, it could be that
someone could get really glum, though,

00:26:06.287 --> 00:26:09.412
like they feel like, "I'm not going
to come up with anything great

00:26:09.436 --> 00:26:12.820
until inspiration on that level strikes."

00:26:12.844 --> 00:26:16.191
What do you say to someone who has
just been trying for years,

00:26:16.215 --> 00:26:19.034
and they feel like
they've done all they can,

00:26:19.058 --> 00:26:21.571
but somehow, the moment
has never quite arrived

00:26:21.595 --> 00:26:25.477
where they come up with anything
that anyone else actually likes?

00:26:25.923 --> 00:26:27.408
EG: Well, I mean ...

00:26:29.072 --> 00:26:32.438
I was that person for a long time.